\par
{\b What this installer does:}\par
- Installs Mnshor to Program Files\par
- Registers and starts the "MnshorService" Windows background service on http://127.0.0.1:5157\par
- Creates Desktop and Start Menu shortcuts to open Mnshor in your default browser\par
\par
All document processing runs 100% locally in memory on your machine.\par
